[
  {
    "id": "c09r001",
    "chapter": "hook",
    "text": "把一枚岩釘放在你手邊。器材文章舉例，一組結繩熟手，一天能放入、取回多達一百枚。",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "第一秒落在觀眾手邊的匿名示意場景，保留一組熟手/一天/多達100枚例示；不指同一枚或同一孔敲100次。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 1,
    "candidate_basis": "declared_retained_text_delta",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S1",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S1.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "f1c68d850f653f19cfd350c76c61a22bb3afe7d4c716b4931d3d2411514e3536",
        "paragraph": "004",
        "paragraph_sha256": "d6f40450b9a8e396b5d59fd443fd8510baf3f0b878641c22ab30fff0ef7aab65"
      }
    ],
    "short_anchor_phrase": "100 pitons a day"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r002",
    "chapter": "hook",
    "text": "如果下一個爬同一道裂縫的人是你，他們帶走釘子，卻可能把越敲越寬的釘孔留給你。",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "S2 1972前言原文：熱門路線裂縫變成成排釘孔、反覆敲拔使岩片鬆落；S4:D small cracks now needed large pitons，窄裂縫擴大需較大釘子；保留如果/可能的觀眾假設，非同孔100次",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 2,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r003",
    "chapter": "hook",
    "text": "想像你翻開一九七二年的器材型錄，桌旁是一枚剛從岩縫拔出的鋼釘。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "1972 型錄的明示假想閱讀場景，不重建史實現場",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 3,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r004",
    "chapter": "hook",
    "text": "器材商修納德，後來創辦 Patagonia；他竟在自家型錄，勸顧客少用岩釘。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "1972 前言",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 4,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r005",
    "chapter": "hook",
    "text": "我覺得最難的還在後面：一次不帶岩釘的攀登，和工廠裡一部仍在動的機器。",
    "source": "S3、S4",
    "anchor": "1973 質疑與攀登；後來工廠報導",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 5,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r006",
    "chapter": "hook",
    "text": "這回，沿著一枚岩釘，把這家器材公司的選擇講清楚。",
    "source": "S1–S4",
    "anchor": "本片編輯承諾",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 6,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r007",
    "chapter": "hook",
    "text": "賣岩釘的人，為什麼要勸你少敲；他勸人的那件商品，後來又怎麼了？",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "全片問題",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 7,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r008",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "想像你打開當年的器材袋，裡面一枚枚軟鐵釘，都是攀岩者為長路線準備的工具。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "早期軟鐵與硬鋼釘段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 8,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r009",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "早年的軟鐵岩釘，原本不打算反覆使用。爬長路線的人得背上幾十枚，越走越知道重量。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "早期軟鐵釘段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 9,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le001",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "報導解釋，軟鐵能順著不規則的裂縫變形；當時追求的是讓釘子貼進岩縫，不是讓它用完還保持原樣。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補明早期材料的變形用途，區分貼合裂縫與可重用的價值。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "malleable iron",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "028",
        "paragraph_sha256": "52002b69b170694db32d0792816351e42c9278830f3f50786ec4e11be764cbda"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r010",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "一九四六年，另一位鐵匠先做出能拔回來重用的硬鋼釘；這個先例，不是修納德的發明。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Salathé 1946 段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 10,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r011",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "一袋金屬能跟著人一段段往上走，負擔輕了；可你真想買，這種釘子去哪裡找？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "前輩硬鋼釘與重用段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 11,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r012",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "可是修納德後來對記者說，到一九五七年，前輩的釘子已買不到，美國也幾乎沒人做這種器材。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Chouinard 回憶 1957 供應段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 12,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r013",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "換成你，買不到合用的東西，也許會換一家問；他的辦法卻是買煤爐和鐵砧，翻書學著做。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Chouinard 回憶鍛造段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 13,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le002",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "他說，自己的釘子用鉻鉬鋼製作；爐旁還有鐵鎚和鉗子，金屬得在手上一步步加工。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "增加當事人所說的合金材料與手工工具，不以材料名稱推價格或利潤。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "chrome-molybdenum steel",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "033",
        "paragraph_sha256": "1da3fcad66da18fd9e8c17932d76ecef436342d3327832e14fbfe4cbf8dd8f2f"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le003",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "同一段回憶裡，連扣環也幾乎是手工：夾在便攜虎鉗上銼修，或用手鑽加工，工具跟著車子搬動。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補手工扣環的銼修與手鑽工序，與後段工人調整扣環形成製造動作的回收。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "hand-drill them",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "033",
        "paragraph_sha256": "1da3fcad66da18fd9e8c17932d76ecef436342d3327832e14fbfe4cbf8dd8f2f"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r014",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "他回憶，把爐子和鐵砧裝上車，沿加州海岸停下來生火鍛造；一個人這樣做，一小時能有幾枚？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Chouinard 回憶沿海鍛造段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 14,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r015",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "他說，只有兩枚。有時一整天都守在爐前，這可不是按一下機器就能掉出一箱。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Chouinard 回憶一小時兩枚段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 15,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r016",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "做好的釘子帶到攀岩區，直接賣給要爬岩壁的人；這樣慢慢打出來的東西，他開什麼價？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Chouinard 回憶攀岩區售貨段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 16,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r017",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "照他的回憶，歐洲岩釘約三十美分，他的一枚卻要一美元半；買家起初嫌貴，後來才漸漸接受。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "價格比較段，皆為本人回憶",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 17,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r018",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "我覺得這個落差很有意思：他賣的是一件小金屬，買家掏錢時卻得想，它值不值得陪自己上岩壁。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "價格段；明示旁白意見",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 18,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r040",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "英國攀岩者早就用上金屬楔塊；這件不是修納德發明的工具，跟岩釘有什麼不同？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "英國楔塊前史",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 38,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le004",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "報導追溯，英國攀岩者早先會用小石塊卡進岩縫，再把短繩套在石頭上；後來，有孔的金屬螺帽也進了器材袋。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補充楔塊從天然石塊到有孔金屬的具體動作，支持替代工具並非品牌首創。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "the hole",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "007",
        "paragraph_sha256": "e9fcee2d0fba38678fd79157ee41154398bf4b8b0beff9f9df634c8817443f05"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le005",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "到了六〇年代初，英國鐵匠開始加工不同尺寸的金屬楔塊；修納德最初用的，則是鋁製飛機螺帽。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補英國加工楔塊與當事人最初使用航空鋁螺帽的區別，讓後接1959/1960的回憶不被誤讀為更早使用六〇年代英國成形楔塊。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "aluminum aircraft nuts",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "007",
        "paragraph_sha256": "e9fcee2d0fba38678fd79157ee41154398bf4b8b0beff9f9df634c8817443f05"
      },
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "008",
        "paragraph_sha256": "36dbc0632ac094a5c99d32d385b1a7c686d687881890c0c4af66615db20b7895"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r041",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "楔塊靠形狀卡在裂縫，攀登之後通常能取回，少了用錘子敲入、再拔出的那一道過程。",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "chocks 的概括原理",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 39,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r043",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "記者寫，修納德在一九五九、一九六〇年，就已經用過楔塊。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "1959／1960 已使用楔塊；不再將1970回信當作當時看法",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 41,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r019",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "他說，夏天在攀岩區賣釘子，冬天備貨給下一個夏天；連一張價目表，都得先提醒顧客什麼？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Could you make a living 段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 19,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r020",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "一九六四年，第一份郵購型錄只是一張油印價目表，下面還提醒：五月到九月，別期待迅速交貨。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "first mail-order 1964 段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 20,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r021",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "記者接著解釋，那正是攀岩季。你看，這張單子連交貨速度，都帶著做器材的人的生活節拍。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "價目表後記者解釋",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 21,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r022",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "可是生意擴大，手工趕不上需求；只靠鐵砧，還能把顧客要的器材交出去嗎？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "本人回憶需求與工坊段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 22,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r023",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "不能只靠鐵砧了。他們改用機器與模具；夥伴原本學航空工程，這時幫上設計模具的忙。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Frost 工程背景段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 23,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r024",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "一九六六年，工坊設在文圖拉的鐵路旁；後來記者走進的公司，也就在那裡。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "Ventura 1966 設址段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 24,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r025",
    "chapter": "origin",
    "text": "釘子做得更多，也用得更順手。對買器材的人，這聽起來全是好事；問題怎麼反而從這裡長出來？",
    "source": "S1、S4",
    "anchor": "可重用器材與量產的編輯銜接",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 25,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r026",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "一九六七年，修納德與夥伴把岩釘的用法寫成文章，",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "1967 文章；承接上章",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 26,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r027",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "記錄攀岩者怎麼放入、拔出釘子。",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "1967 文章；承接上章",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 26,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le006",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "那枚釘子不只接繩。文章還寫，人把腳梯接上扣環，靠器材向上移動，睡覺的吊床也能懸掛在釘子上。",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "補岩釘在人工攀登中連腳梯及吊床的實際角色，讓後續克制使用的取捨有具體負擔。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "sleeping in hammocks",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S1",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S1.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "f1c68d850f653f19cfd350c76c61a22bb3afe7d4c716b4931d3d2411514e3536",
        "paragraph": "004",
        "paragraph_sha256": "d6f40450b9a8e396b5d59fd443fd8510baf3f0b878641c22ab30fff0ef7aab65"
      },
