  {
    "id": "c09le009",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "同一篇文章提醒，最常見的錯誤是把合金釘敲得太深；在垂直裂縫裡，固定力也靠它抵抗轉動，不是只靠猛敲。",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "補明固定與抗轉動的機制，將多敲不一定更好推進到使用取捨。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "overdrive",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S1",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S1.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "f1c68d850f653f19cfd350c76c61a22bb3afe7d4c716b4931d3d2411514e3536",
        "paragraph": "018",
        "paragraph_sha256": "2b0c04fd760b69f17322c35c74beab9f8465ceb4e71d5817763f8150abf6d5bd"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le010",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "原文把放入與取出的時間一起算，還特別提醒忍住多補那一錘：它可能讓回收更難。",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "補放入與取回的總時間及額外一錘的代價，連回可重用商品的實際工作。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "placement time and removal time",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S1",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S1.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "f1c68d850f653f19cfd350c76c61a22bb3afe7d4c716b4931d3d2411514e3536",
        "paragraph": "019",
        "paragraph_sha256": "f2e31ad20925be5a3391507fcd00868e613b55dab292c90a85572fb649cd3ce2"
      },
      {
        "source": "S1",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S1.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "f1c68d850f653f19cfd350c76c61a22bb3afe7d4c716b4931d3d2411514e3536",
        "paragraph": "021",
        "paragraph_sha256": "ce324f786e32352f838cbb5558afabc65bd244ca8313a9f680c92718545d3329"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r030",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "兩位作者甚至把流暢的放入、取回，形容成成熟的技藝。人把工具用得更好了，可是岩石呢？",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "熟練動作的評語",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 29,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r044",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "報導轉引攀岩書裡一封一九七〇年的回信：他說楔塊有用，",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "轉引 Doug Scott 所收 1970 回信",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 42,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r045",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "平常卻不會取代岩釘。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "轉引 Doug Scott 所收 1970 回信",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 42,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r031",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "可你把視線從人的手移到岩縫，同一個動作就有了另一種帳：人拿回釘子，岩石承受那一下敲擊。",
    "source": "S1、S2",
    "anchor": "個人重用與累積傷痕對照",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 30,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r032",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "一組人走過，後面還有一組；大家都在重用自己的工具，反覆碰著同一道裂縫，岩壁留下了什麼？",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "熱門路線累積損傷",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 31,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r033",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "一九七二年的型錄前言說，在優勝美地的熱門路線，反覆敲拔已讓裂縫出現一排排釘孔。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "1972 前言優勝美地段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 32,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r034",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "還記得開場那道岩縫嗎？合金鋼比花崗岩硬，薄石片還可能在敲拔時鬆動、剝落。",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "明示回呼002的岩縫；S2合金鋼相對花崗岩硬度及敲拔使薄片鬆動/剝落，未重述擴寬結果",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 33,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r035",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "讀到這裡，我覺得「可重複使用」不夠完整：",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "明示旁白反應",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 34,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r036",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "釘子帶得回來；岩縫變寬後，原來的小釘子還能用嗎？",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "明示旁白反應",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 34,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r037",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "報導還寫，某些裂縫已大到原來的小釘子不合用，後來的人得換更大的釘子；工具跟著傷痕變了。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "裂縫擴大需更大釘子段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 35,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le011",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "而且能回收也有期限。那份器材文章說，合金釘會長時間保持形狀，但出現疲勞裂紋就該退役。",
    "source": "S1",
    "anchor": "補金屬疲勞而外形可仍保留的生命週期，不把可重用寫成永久不需更換。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "fatigue cracks",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S1",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S1.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "f1c68d850f653f19cfd350c76c61a22bb3afe7d4c716b4931d3d2411514e3536",
        "paragraph": "049",
        "paragraph_sha256": "5a9b8c89b41f065124dcf02bd3f6d6c23e1175448ec821be574f62c6fdc35fc3"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r038",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "那個後來的人可能就是你。背包裡的器材是自己的，眼前這塊岩石，卻接著前面所有人的選擇。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "未來攀登者段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 36,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r039",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "還記得前面那枚楔塊嗎？兩種工具都能取回；現在，岩壁的代價讓這個差別變得更具體。",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "替代工具問題",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 37,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r042",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "不過，不同裂縫有不同條件；換一件工具，也不能當成安全保證。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "適用性界線",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 40,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r046",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "還記得剛才變寬的岩縫嗎？他說自己原以為攀岩不傷岩石；這個發現，他寫到了哪裡？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "當事人後來對轉念的回憶",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 43,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r047",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "回到開場那本型錄，他們給的建議是：在合適路線上，",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "1972 前言",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 44,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r048",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "優先考慮可拆楔塊。商品之外，多了一個次序。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "1972 前言",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 44,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r049",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "前言說，山脈並非取之不盡，連使用自家器材都要克制；那它到底怎麼衡量一次攀登的成功？",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "1972 前言倫理主張",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 45,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r050",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "不只看有沒有到頂，還看攀登的方式。我覺得最反常的，",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "編輯推進",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 46,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r051",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "就是賣工具的人開始叫你想，這一下要不要敲。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "編輯推進",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 46,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r052",
    "chapter": "idea",
    "text": "可是你真的拿著錘子站在岩壁下，光讀到一句「請克制」，就會知道下一步該怎麼選嗎？",
    "source": "S2、S3",
    "anchor": "型錄含教學長文的轉場",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 47,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r053",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "不會，所以型錄裡除了勸告，還得把新的選擇交到顧客手上。前言先把不同路線的條件分開。",
    "source": "S2、S3",
    "anchor": "型錄前言及長文；接上章",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 48,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r054",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "原本就不用岩釘的路線，繼續保留這個做法；",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "原先無岩釘路線段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 49,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r055",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "其他合適的路線，照剛才那個次序先試可拆楔塊，不把所有裂縫當成一樣。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "原先無岩釘路線段",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 49,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r056",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "真有必要，前言說可以考慮固定岩釘，減少一再敲拔；可是留在那裡，後來的人怎麼知道？",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "必要時固定岩釘例外",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 50,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r057",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "位置還要記進當地攀登指南，讓後來的人知道。留下一件器材，也要把資訊留給後來的人。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "local guide books",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 51,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r058",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "我覺得難處還在你翻完冊子以後：換一件工具，只讀前言就夠嗎？",
    "source": "S2、S3",
    "anchor": "旁白明示意見與換工具是否只讀前言的問句；054–057完整保留路線/例外規則，060–061以型錄教學長文回答",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 52,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r060",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "型錄接著請另一位攀岩作者，寫一篇不用岩釘攀登的長文。",
    "source": "S2、S3",
    "anchor": "Doug Robinson 長文",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 53,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r061",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "前言說為什麼改，長文則教器材怎麼換。",
    "source": "S2、S3",
    "anchor": "Doug Robinson 長文",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 53,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le012",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "後來的採訪把這段教學寫得更具體：它有十四頁，談楔塊怎麼搭配，不只列商品和價格。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補教學篇幅及其功能，具體回答只看前言是否足夠。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "fourteen-page",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "010",
        "paragraph_sha256": "bbf233246fdc7743318c823cd35facb662c281ca36e769fcd8aa61a832e3cf03"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le013",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "報導提到，有時要組合不只一個楔塊，還要把幾個支點連起來；讀者得重新理解器材和岩縫的配合。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補教學內容涉及組合楔塊與相連支點，而非把換工具化約為換購物清單。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "two or more",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "010",
        "paragraph_sha256": "bbf233246fdc7743318c823cd35facb662c281ca36e769fcd8aa61a832e3cf03"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le014",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "同篇採訪裡，他估計，投入攀岩的人在普通人工攀登約帶二十個不同尺寸、形狀的楔塊；大岩壁可能要六十個。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補當事人對普通人工攀登與大岩壁攜帶量的估計，限定歷史受訪說法而非現代裝備清單。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "twenty chocks",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "009",
        "paragraph_sha256": "e283bd886c9500a653c84742a5b9b2d443c47e0e83ef82a0ca3030cec9a2364a"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r062",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "一九七三年的書評，把這份型錄列為七十二頁。",
    "source": "S3、S4",
    "anchor": "1973 書評列72頁",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 54,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r063",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "從早年的單張價目表，現在變成能放下一篇長文的冊子。",
    "source": "S3、S4",
    "anchor": "1973 書評列72頁",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 54,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r064",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "你可能會問，這種改法不只是漂亮的理念嗎？作者得用什麼，讓顧客相信器材選擇真的會有差別？",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "商業型錄與教學並存",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 55,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r065",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "前言還舉英國的舊路線：落腳的地方早已磨亮，保護用裂縫卻仍完整，因為那裡沒有敲岩釘。",
    "source": "S2",
    "anchor": "英國舊路線例示",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 56,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r068",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "但這本冊子畢竟也在賣器材。你翻到勸人克制的那一頁，",
    "source": "S2、S3",
    "anchor": "倡議/銷售並存",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 58,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r069",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "再看到商品價格，心裡會不會冒出一句話？",
    "source": "S2、S3",
    "anchor": "倡議/銷售並存",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 58,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r070",
    "chapter": "engine",
    "text": "回到開場那本型錄：讀到這份勸告，你會相信賣家，還是覺得他說一套、做一套？",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "評論者記錄質疑",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 59,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r071",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "書評裡確實有人這樣批評：修納德一邊販賣岩釘，一邊卻在貶低它。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "1973 書評；接上章",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 60,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r072",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "這是書評記下的指責，不是公司內部承認的算盤；但我覺得，它正好戳中顧客最難放心的地方。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "質疑歸屬",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 61,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r073",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "還有人覺得，先靠岩釘爬上難線的人，",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "攀登自由爭議",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 62,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r074",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "憑什麼要求後來者換工具？攀登的選擇，不該被別人替你決定。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "攀登自由爭議",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 62,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le015",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "反彈不只來自年輕人。書評還引述一份在東岸廣為流傳、由年長攀岩者寫的文字。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "保留書評引述、年長作者與東岸流傳地；本句只交代批評的歸屬，下一句承接原有批評，不增加作者地緣或絕對量詞。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "On the east coast a widely-circulated notice written by an older climber",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S3",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S3.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "436ee77e5956f640034df4c4e85497e63b413792e0c5b6a24ad2e28b60d49af7",
        "paragraph": "007",
        "paragraph_sha256": "238447e2201fedb0eac6a89092885304e824904642fc47cbea27246139f3fb65"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le022",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "那位作者嫌型錄裡有「買不起的器材」和「不需要的說教」。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "承接c09le015已交代的年長作者，保留原批評內容與書評歸屬；由r2單景拆出以符合12秒分鏡上限，沒有新增史實。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "equipment you can’t afford and sermons you don’t need",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S3",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S3.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "436ee77e5956f640034df4c4e85497e63b413792e0c5b6a24ad2e28b60d49af7",
        "paragraph": "007",
        "paragraph_sha256": "238447e2201fedb0eac6a89092885304e824904642fc47cbea27246139f3fb65"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le016",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "書評也說，有些不滿者仍承認這種倫理在道德上是對的；只是他們覺得，自己的登山自由也被押上了。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "補反對者也承認倫理方向但擔心個人自由的矛盾，避免把反彈寫成只想破壞岩石。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "their freedom as an individual",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S3",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S3.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "436ee77e5956f640034df4c4e85497e63b413792e0c5b6a24ad2e28b60d49af7",
        "paragraph": "005",
        "paragraph_sha256": "904ef91951eaa168edeb8e3c56a4519d2ea86e8f0ccc7e44956dd6366cf5055b"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r075",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "另一個疑問更直接：如果真照他說的，不帶岩釘去爬大岩壁，會不會連路線都完成不了？",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "大岩壁可行性疑慮",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 63,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r076",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "書評作者也寫下相反的現場：他在優勝美地，遇到更多想不帶錘子攀登的人。這是他的觀察。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "Rowell 個人所見",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 64,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r077",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "他不同意「說一套做一套」的指責，認為型錄確實花了篇幅，教顧客怎麼少用錘子。",
    "source": "S3",
    "anchor": "Rowell 的評價",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 65,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r078",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "不過那是書評作者的判斷；換到真正的大岩壁，你看修納德與夥伴的器材袋，裡面又裝了什麼？",
    "source": "S3、S4",
    "anchor": "轉到一次攀登",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 66,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r079",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "開場那次不帶岩釘的攀登，說的就是這裡：一九七三年，修納德和夥伴帶著楔塊，去爬酋長岩一條著名長路線。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "親讀S4:009後把相對『同年』澄清為明文1973；其餘伙伴/長路線與未帶岩釘範圍不補未說細節。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 67,
    "candidate_basis": "declared_retained_text_delta",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "009",
        "paragraph_sha256": "e283bd886c9500a653c84742a5b9b2d443c47e0e83ef82a0ca3030cec9a2364a"
      }
    ],
    "short_anchor_phrase": "in 1973"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r080",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "他們完成了這次攀登。這裡的「沒帶」，說的是岩釘，不是繩索，也不是其他攀登裝備。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "1973 攀登完成",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 68,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r082",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "我只把剛才那次攀登，當成那一條路線的答案；不拿它替每一面岩壁作保。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "結果適用範圍",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 70,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r093",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "品牌回顧說，一九七三年，戶外服裝開始使用巴塔哥尼亞標籤。",
    "source": "S7",
    "anchor": "S7 品牌回顧僅支持1973戶外服裝標籤使用；不主張品牌名字首次出現",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 78,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r084",
    "chapter": "turn",
    "text": "開場那個工廠問題還在：那部機器後來在做什麼？",
    "source": "S2、S4",
    "anchor": "工廠問題未解",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 71,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r085",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "一九七七年刊出的報導裡，記者走進文圖拉的店面，看見一個展示舊岩釘的小區域。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "1977 刊出報導；記者走進店面所見舊岩釘展區",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 72,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r086",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "前輩鐵匠與修納德早年親手做的釘子，都成了這裡的展品。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "記者所見舊岩釘小展區",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 73,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r087",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "器材陳列櫃裡，岩釘和楔塊仍在。你可能還不確定，這些是舊存貨，還是工廠真的繼續在做？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "記者所見陳列櫃",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 74,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r088",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "後方工廠裡，他早年的便攜爐閒著，",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "記者所見便攜爐與壓模",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 75,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r089",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "機器卻繼續把金屬壓成新岩釘。老工具歇了，商品沒有只剩回憶。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "記者所見便攜爐與壓模",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 75,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le018",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "工廠裡，工人還在調整扣環的活動門和冰斧柄；同一篇報導，讓這枚釘子回到一座處理多種器材的工廠。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補工廠可見的活動門與冰斧柄調整，不擅自指定工人在壓床旁，也不從生產推財務動機。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "ice-axe handles",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "053",
        "paragraph_sha256": "07e7caee702d8b858ab90cfd4a7e8e22bdfe6d23d129de7bac7784ece0255512"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r090",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "另一邊，一塊像岩壁的木板卡著楔塊，",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "記者所見木板與楔塊展示",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 76,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09le019",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "那塊木板裝著不規則木塊，留出不同的縫，讓楔塊能試各種組合；展示的不只是貨品，也是它怎麼工作。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "補示範板製造裂縫與試不同組合的具體設計，使新用法可見。",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "candidate_basis": "sourced_expansion_with_narrative_connection",
    "short_anchor_phrase": "wooden blocks",
    "candidate_evidence": [
      {
        "source": "S4",
        "cache_path": "/workspace/work/brand-story-20261025/c09-audit/source-cache/S4.paragraphs.txt",
        "cache_sha256": "0e8f818fbdf989ab7d94549c8ada0d562e3f7dc94f9fc9f9fa3ccb36afde9b48",
        "paragraph": "053",
        "paragraph_sha256": "07e7caee702d8b858ab90cfd4a7e8e22bdfe6d23d129de7bac7784ece0255512"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r091",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "鮮明的繩環穿過器材；被提倡的新做法，也有具體的展示。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "記者所見木板與楔塊展示",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 76,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r092",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "你還記得剛才出現的服裝標籤嗎？我覺得更有意思的是：服裝跟這座器材工廠，究竟有什麼關聯？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "明示旁白反應",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 77,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r095",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "修納德說，服裝收入補貼攀岩器材；一座壓岩釘的模具，又要多少錢？",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "記者所見外套；本人補貼說法",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 79,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r096",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "他還說，壓製岩釘的模具要花數千美元，",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "本人對模具成本與回本期估計",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 80,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r097",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "估計有時得五到十年才回本。器材生意，也有自己的難處。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "本人對模具成本與回本期估計",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 80,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r098",
    "chapter": "now",
    "text": "這是他的估算，還不是一份獨立財報。",
    "source": "S4",
    "anchor": "成本說法的證據界線",
    "status": "PENDING_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW",
    "parent_row": 81,
    "candidate_basis": "retained_base_text"
  },
  {
    "id": "c09r100",
    "chapter": "now",
